      },
      "message": "Perf/whitenoise init (#834)\n\n* fix(benchmark): flush tracing on exit and repair seeded-startup script so init failures stop being silent\n\n* feat(config): add WhitenoiseConfig::with_default_account_relays so new accounts publish to configured relays instead of hardcoded defaults\n\n* feat(benchmark): add optional WAN-latency simulation to benchmark recipes via toxiproxy sidecar\n\n* refactor(whitenoise/mod): setup subscriptions in a background task instead of blocking initialization\n\n* feat(whitenoise): defer discovery-plane start and subscription setup to background tasks so Whitenoise::new no longer blocks on relays",
